Coding & Solution
1. User Creation

An authorized test user is created in ServiceNow for validating the access-control implementation.

2. Role Creation

Roles are configured for controlling different operations.

3. Table Creation

The custom table u_institution_details is created to store institution information.

4. Table Fields

The table contains fields including:

Student Roll Number
Student Name
Faculty Name
Branch
Email
Phone Number
Description
5. READ Access

READ access is configured to control which records an authorized user can view.

6. CREATE Access

CREATE access is configured to control who can create new records.

7. WRITE Access

WRITE access is configured to control who can modify existing records.

8. DELETE Access

DELETE access is configured to control who can delete records.

9. Administrator Access

Administrators retain full access to the system and records.
